Package: redcapmissing
Title: Branching-Aware Missingness Reports for REDCap Exports
Version: 5.2.0
Authors@R: person("blankuzr", email = "blankuzr@users.noreply.github.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Build branching-aware missingness reports for REDCap record
    exports using project metadata and structure exposed by the redcapAPI
    package, organized by event/form and repeat-instance validation checks.
